---
description: Testing expectations for behavior changes
globs:
  - "**/*.test.*"
  - "**/*.spec.*"
  - "**/tests/**"
  - "**/__tests__/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing expectations

- Prefer tests that assert observable behavior over implementation details.
- Cover meaningful failure paths, not only the happy path.
- Do not weaken assertions or delete tests to make a change pass.
- Name tests after the behavior under protection so failures are actionable.
